## SQLite

Storage is SQLite (`QGD-ENG-0001`), through the `node:sqlite` module of the
Node.js that Electron carries. Nothing of SQLite is vendored by this product;
it ships inside Electron and under Electron's notices. Recorded here so the
list of what the application relies on is complete.

SQLite is in the public domain: https://sqlite.org/copyright.html

